  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Support the Establishment of Development Strategies  and to Build a Foundation for Skilled and Professional Talents for the Indian Shipbuilding and Marine Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diagnosis and anlysis of the current status of the India-Korea shipbuilding and maritime sectors, establishment of development strategies, manpowwer supply and demand forecasts, and basic plans for skilled talent development, Hosting of a leadership program for senior leaders in the Indian shipbuilding and maritime sectors, organization of a workship for Indian shipbuilding and maritime sector experts visiting South Korean shipyards, formulation and operation of a skilled talent development strategy association for the shipbuilding and maritime sectors in India and South Korea, and holding forums, conducting capacity building training on systems, policies, and field visits for South Korean experts visiting India.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Indian government&apos;s efforts to establish and implement plans to develop the shipbuilding and maritime sector as a strategic national industry, and contribute to the advancement of the sector in india by analyzing the current status of human resources by degree, qualification, and skill level, and supporting the development of plans for specialized and skilled talent, based on South Korea&apos;s leading technology and experience in the global shipbuilding and maritime industry. Additionally, assist in creating employment opportunities for Indian nationals in related industries, including those of leading countries in shipbuilding and maritime secotrs.&#xc138;&#xacc4; &#xc870;&#xc120;&#xd574;&#xc591; &#xbd84;&#xc57c;&#xb97c; &#xc120;&#xb3c4;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xd55c;&#xad6d;&#xc758; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xb825;&#xacfc; &#xacbd;&#xd5d8;&#xc744; &#xd1a0;&#xb300;&#xb85c; &#xd559;&#xc704; &#xc790;&#xaca9; &#xc219;&#xb828;&#xc218;&#xc900;&#xbcc4; &#xc778;&#xb825; &#xd604;&#xd669; &#xbd84;&#xc11d; &#xbc0f;  &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xc219;&#xb828;&#xc778;&#xc7ac; &#xc591;&#xc131; &#xacc4;&#xd68d; &#xc218;&#xb9bd; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; &#xb4f1;</narrative>
  </description>
